WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:10.595
Welcome to Suburbicon, a town of
great wonder and excitement.

00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:11.394
He-hey there!

00:00:11.394 --> 00:00:14.219
Filled with the promise of prosperity for all.

00:00:16.029 --> 00:00:19.169
Nicky, you need to get up. There are men in the house.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.779
Son, there's something I have to tell you.

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:30.779
Those men killed Mom.

00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:35.039
We've decided it'd be best if your Auntie
Margaret came and stayed with us.

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:36.219
Nicky needs a mother.

00:00:36.219 --> 00:00:38.219
We'll be strong. We'll be fine.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.090
Mr Lodge?

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:40.590
Yes.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:42.750
You know a character named Rizzoli? He's a loan shark.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:47.339
If you were into the mob for money, that
might explain what happened to your life?

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.500
Hi, pal.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.060
This is the last time that clown's gonna ignore us.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:00:59.220
Take care of the kid.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.754
These animals took everything from us.

00:01:16.754 --> 00:01:19.429
I have to make decisions like what's best for the family.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:25.980
It's the police.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:27.460
Any progress on the investigation?

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.580
A mobster got killed a couple of days ago.

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:35.180
I'm sorry for his loss.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.780
Of life? Yeah, I guess he probably is too.

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.520
I'm here to collect.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.500
What do you want?

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.080
I want all of it.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:44.960
All of it.

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.180
Nothing like this ever happened here.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.720
This is a safe place.

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:50.460
It was.

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.180
Would you like a cup of coffee?

00:01:58.480 --> 00:01:59.820
I could have you killed in no time.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:03.740
I could kill you too.

